Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}38.3度…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比昨天稍微低了點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天整天都要這樣好好睡著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗波 媽媽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她上完夜班回來之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就出去買東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快遞？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我稍微出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 我們是來探望海果的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…雖然我不知道你們是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但如果你們是來捉弄姐姐的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還請等她康復之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊？什麼啊 我看起來像是來找碴的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼看都是找碴的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}突然來打擾真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天 海果在社團活動時突然暈倒…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我收到海果他們社團同學的消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她們還帶海果去醫院了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有朋友在一起真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…我從媽媽那裡聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嚇到你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐原來真的有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒想到那傢伙竟然真的是姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.83,0:02:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐 我要進來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你社團的同學來看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}完全沒注意到你的身體不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真是個爛到不行的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來吧 多吸入一點宇宙能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明內同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Supiiv！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Supiiv!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的是姐姐的朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們是友raav！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別說外星語了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她等會又要瞎想了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家能來看我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像是感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該好好睡一覺就差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們買來了好多好多好吃的果凍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多吃點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可能是我讓你太勉強了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要再在一起…做火箭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以那你就快點好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬的臉怎麼有點小紅呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不會是感冒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我來試試你有沒有發燒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.29,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就讓我試一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吵架就去外面吵
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.00,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我說了走開的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在要喝粥嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.05,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬簡直就是個壞脾氣外星人
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.00,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}閉嘴 天丸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭 感覺舒服了不少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為什麼是連我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一個讓我來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思 帶了這麼多人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 能幫我忙 多謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天你父母都在工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽媽剛剛回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但又出去買東西去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽媽在水族館工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有時候還會值夜班…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上因為姐姐我也沒睡好覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是個好妹妹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站著也能睡著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是有她姐姐沒有的幹練呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖 乖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然如此 就把我的手臂借給你用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 你去把會長的冷頭貼給換了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧 我來把這孩子安置到沙發上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.25,0:05:21.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 你要過來幫我做飯哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭…好燙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幫幫我 明內…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.43,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感應…感應~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃感應 瞬感應
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃感應 瞬感應
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 明內同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還 還有…我的額頭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 海果你不是說不想要額門感應嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以和海果的話 是絕對不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天和遙乃再做一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂喂 不要把我漏了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就讓瞬來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}燒得好像…更厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是辛苦你了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多虧了海果你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家才能重新再聚到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看 就跟我和你說過的一樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果已經成為一個出色的會長了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 把你弄醒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明內同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你有什麼想吃的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃和瞬她們剛…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 冷頭貼換過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果她怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 你的臉怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發燒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想和你做…額門感應
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為我…所以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只能和我做…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額門…額門…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的額門都賣完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是…也沒人想買啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次補貨是什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次…下一次…下一次是…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.16,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額門…好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明今天有客人來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}總之 恭喜海果會長痊癒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麻煩大家擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感冒能好真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後是瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恭喜瞬復學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這種話就不用說了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓人怪彆扭的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷門同學 真的是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別給我擺那種讓人肉麻表情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的 老師一整天都對我不溫不火的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷門 上課不可以溜號哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笑原老師一直都很擔心你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多管閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你這個表裡不一的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才是最表裡如一的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}信不信把你的額門打飛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要突然鬆手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 從去看海果的時候開始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就有點不對勁了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難…難道你被我傳染了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不是 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭…在燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都說了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 那個 這個先不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來 應該是火箭研究同好會的重啟儀式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別轉移話題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果會長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來的活動內容是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之前的氣勢都去哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我們再一起去追逐天空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我們還有好多目標
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得一件一件慢慢考慮…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}總 總之 我認為得先把明年的錦標賽搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得一年之後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在 在那之前…我們得必須先被學校認可…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後晉升為社團…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如 如果一直是同好會的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}申請發射場所會非常困難…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不危險嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且…也不能把所有的工作…都放在這地下做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有資金…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們為什麼不在學校發射火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好讓老師們都大吃一驚呢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.01,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記下 記下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是想廢部嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回顧過去的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:11:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有外來植物研究會 通過植物科學研究的比賽的獎項
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而被升為正式社團的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外來…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記下記下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們怎麼可能依靠那種虛幻的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好刻薄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我們自掏腰包做到現在的模型火箭 也可以有效活用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記下記下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我們給地方的小比賽 掀起一場風暴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我查過過往的成績
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要把回收的火箭循環利用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就可以輕易入圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用最短的路線升格致勝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在明年的錦標賽讓立岡的傢伙哭出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這邊才是本心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在 在小比賽中拿出成績
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後在全國大賽上擊敗…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}停停
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個不用寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個說到底只是我的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用把它列為同好會的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想賦予自己做的東西一些意義
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只能做出自己不滿意的成績的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記錄一直空缺什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在明年的錦標賽我也會復仇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是為了我的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而參加這個同好會的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以會長也的要問問自己想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後考慮接下來同好會的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可別像之前一樣 考慮一些奇怪的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而自顧自消沉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自己的…目標
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想能…普通地和別人說話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一直…在反 反思 錦 錦標賽的演講
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想著「如果能說得更好」就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果一直放任著不擅長的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那這以後一定會有更多失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不想以後眼裡都是那 那樣的失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}加上這些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想成為一個好的會長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這就是我現在的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是 我是說了「問問自己想要的」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}目標是交流能力什麼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}跟同 同好會沒什麼關係 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們會幫你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我呢 其實還沒找到像大家一樣的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果和瞬有想實現的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽也有要回自己母星的大目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我還沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說過「我不會有能發自內心喜歡的東西」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才的也只是現學現賣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以如果有我能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我都想去努力試試
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後如果在這個過程中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能找到屬於自己的東西的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我會把大家的意見都統合起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}重新想活動計劃的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}按我們的節奏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}腳踏實地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去為了那枚可以到達天際的火箭去努力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之果同學 Bona早~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}歐 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早上avuu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}趨 趨之以視 見其筒中 中 有光出矣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}更 更復察斯 則有美人 身長三寸 居 居於其中
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.70,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之星同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}注意呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭錦標賽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全國大賽二連霸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}立岡科學技術高中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安如磐石的發射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是王者風範
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.05,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}制勝全國大賽 好帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}立岡是…是那個理科學校嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是在預選賽和小之星同學們龍爭虎鬥過的隊伍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害呀 小之果同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是 我們一點都不厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只輸了一屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨 昨天看了決賽的直播後
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我給秋 秋月前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發了祝賀資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她說這個就是優勝的獎盃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明年我們要變得更強
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後一起去決賽比拼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家在看什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是模型火箭的發射錄影
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是用火藥的引擎發射的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木梨同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}平時她都會來和我搭話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是因為我不中用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次交流都沒有成功過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺好乏味呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點也不乏味啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之果同學她們也在玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊！老是突然說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}實際上確實是有點乏味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但就是這點好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭現在很流行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對吧 小之星同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這種時候不正是宣傳你們活動的絕好機會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想能…普通地和別人說話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木 木梨同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模 模型火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然準備的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可能是有些無趣和乏味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但 發射的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被小之星同學叫名字了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.32,0:17:02.69,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會非常迅猛的飛上天空
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.69,0:17:03.38,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.38,0:17:05.25,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}非常帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我今天…也帶了實物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…可 可能被木梨同學…討厭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畢竟說了那麼多 就像個狂熱粉絲一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不能這麼說 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨她都有認真在聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}認真在聽…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}確 確實…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我在說的時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}木梨同學聽到一半就一言不發了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}思考已經游離天外了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 不能這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}梨也說了後面會看錄影的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊對啊 而且還交換了聯絡方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把錄影的網址傳給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}話說我們有交換聯絡方式嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明就坐在前後位置的 卻現在才交換
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然被她笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過能交換到 真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開始社團會議吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是這股氣勢 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要回點什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們也發點照片過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}照…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.50,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂 別把鏡頭對著我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好開心的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦 天已經那麼黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已經到天黑得更早的季節了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明內同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有 有 有東西忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 你們先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果她 真的 變得堅強了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為我想找到自己的歸宿
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.42,0:19:22.58,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的護目鏡好酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.65,0:19:26.47,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我想應該全都傳達到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對 對不起…我沒有做好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我們一起朝著天空努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那傢伙一直都很堅強的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭好熱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}飛走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 找到明內同學了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海 海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還 還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道是一直
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}身體有什麼不舒服的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒 沒有那種事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可能是宇宙能量變得不安定了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不要勉強哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有什麼需要的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我會帶過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過不過 我可是活力滿滿的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃 額頭有些涼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然明日同學平時都有些涼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明日同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的一點事都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}額頭感應
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只和我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都是因為海果說那種話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 今天 我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是…沒和任何人做…額頭感應嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是今天的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明…內同…學？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的臉…很紅哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗶卟嗶卟…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}果 果然身體不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不不不 沒事了沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明 明內同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我稍 稍微借一下額頭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果這麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼關心著我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼…樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我接收到了很多 海果的關心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直都是這樣對我直抒胸臆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:21:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還閃閃亮亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}非常溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果第一次給我自我介紹的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}將來的夢想是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開著自己做的宇宙飛船去往太空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去宇宙裡尋找外星人的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外星人的同伴…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.99,0:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}坐大家製作的火箭去往宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是我現在的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直以來都謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明內同學
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然還不太…可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.87,0:22:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有啦 海果的話一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕對要一起去宇宙！
